["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"44. 谈诺贝尔经济奖与40+消失在黄金阶梯上的女人 greedy jobs quiet revolution marriage bar statistical discrimination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-28-zhangxiaojun-女性职场起步领先-生育惩罚却把优势磨光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48345482b5ed098b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">53:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>女性职场起步领先，生育惩罚却把优势磨光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刚毕业时男女就业参与率几乎一样，过十年女性就落下来了，再过十几年又部分回去——这条曲线与生育时间高度吻合。被磨掉的不是能力，是连续的积累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性别经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">生育惩罚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"43.【汽车史话03】从“盛产管理大师”的通用汽车，看美式车企百年荣辱 BU T型车 take home pay Telematics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-22-zhangxiaojun-通用汽车盛产管理大师-是因为创始人被赶走了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a723fc2ffc4b4ee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>通用汽车盛产管理大师，是因为创始人被赶走了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人杜兰特被财团扫地出门，反而让通用成了职业经理人的土壤——斯隆的BU制、德鲁克的管理学都长在这里。家族不放手的福特，则始终没有职业经理人的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车产业</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"42.【汽车史话02】集权者福特与全球第二畅销T型车的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70e535c84a96bcfc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型车曾占全球市场一半，却因19年不换代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款车让普通人买得起汽车，T型车一度占据全球汽车销量的一半以上；但正因为它只有一个品种、一个颜色、十九年不换代，消费者没有换车的理由，市场被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"41.【汽车史话01】世界上第一辆燃油车、女车手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3a530c55a91b164-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽车只是马车上加个发动机，马车公司却一家没活下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽车不是马车上加一台发动机那么简单：动力总成换了，整个技术栈和市场跟着换，当年造车厢的马车公司没有一家活过百年。今天衡量电动车企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的电池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车史</span><span class=\"tag\">内燃机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"38. 和软银愿景原GP聊聊，大模型全球降温后，人工智能何去何从 Foundation Model society of minds EV/EBITDA bottom-up\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-20-zhangxiaojun-大模型降温不是坏事-是几十年的技术大周期才刚起步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aff773d4596719b4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大模型降温不是坏事，是几十年的技术大周期才刚起步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言大模型只是机器在反刍人类已经消化过的知识，真正的机器智能会直接从世界观察学习；降温后坚持做事的人才能走到最后。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">技术周期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"37. 小冰李笛讲点真心话：只做大模型不追求商业模式是很难生存的 API 思维链 混合模型 数字员工\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-16-zhangxiaojun-把自己定义成大模型公司-是一个都活不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e116190fb0ec101f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>把自己定义成大模型公司，是一个都活不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李笛说大模型公司不是10个死9个，而是界定成大模型公司就一个都活不了——因为创造的价值和收到的钱是两回事，API 定价贴着成本走，利润上限只有每千 token 0.2 美分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型商业模式</span><span class=\"tag\">小冰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"36.【做个生意吧！】跳向后海的年轻人、酒精和下沉年代 MVP SOP social ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-13-zhangxiaojun-跳海不投营销-一个人站进吧台-店外就多20个客人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0765e6dc8bc37b76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>跳海不投营销：一个人站进吧台，店外就多20个客人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">跳海从不花钱投小红书和抖音，它的增长引擎是打酒师：请熟客和朋友来站吧台，一个人站进去，他外面的朋友就会来，店外就多20个人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社群运营</span><span class=\"tag\">线下连锁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"35. 200位GP赶去中东募资？聊聊沙漠上的白袍、主权基金和金钱王国 LP GP family office carry ADQ ADIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-07-zhangxiaojun-中东主权基金不投小项目-中国gp第一次拿钱要等18个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e25de1254344a81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>中东主权基金不投小项目，中国GP第一次拿钱要等18个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中东资本是哑铃型结构：主权基金和family office两头大、中间空。主权基金越来越直投化，要的是反投和产业落地，不是财务回报。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">主权基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"34. 被忽视的中腰部公司活得还好吗？他们的欲望、挣扎与天命 Permanent Head Damage BAU cut off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-31-zhangxiaojun-中腰部公司不是小公司-是二级赛道里被忽视的王者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ab22b27de95a023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>中腰部公司不是小公司，是二级赛道里被忽视的王者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它们大多是一个千亿级二级赛道里的第一或第二名，创始人从不甘心只做中腰部，但赛道出身极大程度上决定了它们的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中腰部公司</span><span class=\"tag\">二级赛道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"33.【职场人性】企业内斗，究竟在斗什么？ Silo OGSM integrity organizational awareness resourceful\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-19-zhangxiaojun-内斗是显性的-内耗才是组织的慢性自杀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82ee0734b369d003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0719</span></div>\n<h2>内斗是显性的，内耗才是组织的慢性自杀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">内斗看得见、还能吃瓜，内耗看不见、却被当成制度流程本身；真正拖垮公司的不是谁跟谁斗，而是资源冗余、方向缺失下人人追求存在感。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span><span class=\"tag\">职场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"32. 第一个把查理·芒格引入中国的人和出版风云 咖啡书 马尔萨斯陷阱 双轨分析 系统一\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-10-zhangxiaojun-把芒格引入中国的人-出版黄金十年已经落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f1e5f8dcbbb78e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>把芒格引入中国的人：出版黄金十年已经落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出版业没有定价权，京东把图书当引流品亏着卖，行业几百亿规模在它眼里只是广告费。施宏俊说出版会变成边缘行业，但也会变得更「高贵」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出版</span><span class=\"tag\">芒格</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"31.【趋势2023】和老范从退潮的内容投资谈起 carry BP MR NFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-03-zhangxiaojun-投资人不再投纯内容-因为内容是马鞍不是千里马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9608565a6d569392-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0703</span></div>\n<h2>投资人不再投纯内容，因为内容是马鞍不是千里马</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">内容公司成功率远高于绝大多数生意，但天花板由产业特质决定：百花齐放意味着集中度低。所以投资人把内容当鞭子，去找能骑的千里马。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容投资</span><span class=\"tag\">播客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮来势汹汹，外企CEO何故密集访华？ CDR 红筹架构 FDI 国际版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集访华：逆全球化是政治问题，不是经济问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化来势汹汹却挡不住CEO们排队来华，因为脱钩违反经济规律；但真正推动脱钩的不是经济逻辑，而是老大防老二的政治逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">外资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"26. 令德国人惊吓的上海车展：一幅当代汽车众生图 just in time OTA For China For China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-23-zhangxiaojun-车展最热闹的一年-也是合资品牌最危险的一年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec1dcb3e2905617e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>车展最热闹的一年，也是合资品牌最危险的一年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国品牌市占率会很快提高，合资品牌若不能给合资公司带来价值，就可能变成独资品牌——这是车展热闹背后真正的洗牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">上海车展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI开源、亚马逊新动作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffbd8664f0cee8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底层战争已结束，垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底层大模型是年轻人借微软算力做出的涌现，但真正赚钱的行业副驾驶属于创业老兵——三分之二的垂直机会已被ChatGPT自己干掉，剩下的是数据、社交和商业模式的组合战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"24.【趋势2023】从北森IPO看充满挑战的中国企服这两年 PS NDR PMF fine tune pre-chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-12-zhangxiaojun-企服公司2025年上市潮-先做后说-ps回到10倍以下/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8dd48df98352813c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0512</span></div>\n<h2>企服公司2025年上市潮：先做后说，PS回到10倍以下</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去两三年整个企业服务市场被高估了50%到100%，PS从三四十倍回落到十倍以下。北森IPO是「丐版IPO」，但它是中国SaaS系统性上市的第一枪，2025年将有一波企服上市潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业服务</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"22. 要做中国OpenAI？李志飞劝各位同仁冷静点 self-supervised in-context learning AGI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-16-zhangxiaojun-李志飞劝退通用大模型-中国不会有第二个-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bbf2eb9a18261c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0416</span></div>\n<h2>李志飞劝退通用大模型：中国不会有第二个 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他一个月前说要当中国 OpenAI，现在说这个命题大概率不存在——因为共识达成太快、难度被开源和算力迅速拉低，而 OpenAI 自己能不能从商业上笑到最后都不好说。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"21. 投资人视角下的大模型和市场真实水温｜和梦秋聊ChatGPT Killing App Prompt Engineering COT Fine tuning Middle layer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-08-zhangxiaojun-大模型是大厂的菜-创业公司别走-jasper-的老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dff80d1dde94dc31-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0408</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是大厂的菜，创业公司别走 Jasper 的老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是搜索引擎的替代品而是补充，真正的机会在医疗、材料这类大模型抓不到数据的垂直领域，而通用大模型本身只属于巨头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前记者空降巴西，她的拉美商业游记 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23388c61192213d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中国，但中间公司活不下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的税收和劳工法让大公司和小团队都能活，唯独中间规模的公司被夹死；政治左右摇摆本身是确定的，创业者把它当成可控制的变量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷银行危机未结束：未来风险传导的3个可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46b66f8e0ad7b880-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷银行倒闭：美联储只保存款人，不保股东</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储做了一个黑白分明的决定：三万户机构存款人全额保护，股东血本无归。这不是雷曼时刻，而是一个时间差——但美国信誉的慢性下滑可能才刚开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷银行</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"18. 商业口述史：从美国往事，到Google输掉OpenAI第一局 money follows eyeball Transformer Alphabet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-14-zhangxiaojun-雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌-因为不信搜索能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b956cb3f645c5229-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0314</span></div>\n<h2>雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌，因为不信搜索能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雅虎和宝洁都犯过同一个错：不相信搜索会走到前台、不相信美国人会坐在街边喝星巴克。创始人过早退到二线，公司就失去了赌一把的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业口述史</span><span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"17.【趋势2023】沉闷的港股会好吗、富豪的家办与苦恼 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客户 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a527783c09130bf7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族办公室比家族还多，香港的财富管理时代才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股从14000点反弹50%只是情绪修复，真正的新趋势是香港从Fintech转向Wealth Management——但家办门槛低到没有牌照要求，鱼龙混杂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族办公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"16.【趋势2023】那些挣到钱、消失的互联网中高层去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd9c22e61c238c2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二，但这不是年龄问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网二十年高增长靠技术红利和用户红利，红利掩盖了管理能力的缺失；今天组织膨胀变成内耗，出走是行业自我校正，而不是35岁危机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网</span><span class=\"tag\">职业经理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的语言政策、暧昧和青年迷思 两文三语 微调教学语言 吴庆瑞报告书 特选学校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21c3ed4be09c6fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港两文三语只有3%到5%的人能做到，这是个失败的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港坚持一个只有3%到5%的人能达到的语言政策目标，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了从双语并重到英文为主的转向，代价是消灭方言和压制反对派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">语言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>"]